# Renvor — repository ignore rules
#
# Scope: spec FR-024 requires that a full verification run on a clean checkout leaves
# no untracked or modified files. Exclusions decided at T009 are enforced here.
#
# NOTE: these rules prevent FUTURE commits only. Material already committed is not
# removed by ignoring it — see the pre-push blocker in governance/phase-001-evidence.md.

# --- Rust build output ---
target/
debug/
**/*.rs.bk
*.rlib
*.prof*

# --- Node and documentation site output ---
node_modules/
.docusaurus/
build/
.cache/
docs/build/

# --- Editor and IDE state ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Operating-system artifacts ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs and temporary files ---
*.log
tmp/
*.tmp

# --- Environment, credentials, and secrets (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials
credentials.*
secrets/
*.secret

# --- Python (local tooling only) ---
.venv/
__pycache__/

# --- Local agent and development-tool configuration (T009: excluded from the public repository) ---
.claude/
.claude-flow/
.playwright-mcp/
.remember/
.specify/

# --- Separately managed brand package, separate asset licensing (T009) ---
Branding/

# --- Superseded planning documents, retained locally as research references (T009) ---
RENVOR_FRAMEWORK_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md
RENVOR_MASTER_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
